The '''Mothma Estate''' was a location on the [[planet]] [[Chandrila]] owned by the [[Mothma family]]. The [[Wedding of Stekan Sculdun and Leida Mothma|wedding]] of [[Leida Mothma]] and [[Stekan Sculdun]] was held at the estate.<ref name="OYL" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The area around the estate is based on the mountain range that surrounds the [[Wikipedia:Santa Maria de Montserrat Abbey|Santa Maria de Montserrat Abbey]] in Catalonia, Spain.<ref name="Week1Trivia">{{SW|url=news/andor-trivia-guide-week-1|text=Secrets from the Set of ''Andor'' Season 2: Week 1 Trivia}}</ref>

